    {
      "source": "Set a <a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> class for this query, creating a fresh\n<a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> instance per execution.",
      "translation": "为此查询设置一个 <a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> 类，每次执行时创建一个新的 <a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set a specific <a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> instance to use for this query.",
      "translation": "为此查询设置一个特定的<a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "A concrete variant of <a href=\"SqlQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.object\"><code>SqlQuery</code></a> which can be configured\nwith a <a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一种具体的<a href=\"SqlQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.object\"><code>SqlQuery</code></a>变体，可以配置为使用<a href=\"../core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses must implement this method to extract an object per row, to be\nreturned by the <code>execute</code> method as an aggregated <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>.",
      "translation": "子类必须实现此方法以按行提取对象，以便由 <code>execute</code> 方法作为聚合的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 返回。",
      "count": 2
    },
