    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - the contextual information passed to the <code>mapRow</code>\ncallback method. The JDBC operation itself doesn't rely on this parameter,\nbut it can be useful for creating the objects of the result list.",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> - 传递给 <code>mapRow</code> 回调方法的上下文信息。JDBC 操作本身不依赖此参数，但它在创建结果列表中的对象时可能很有用。",
